 .:[ 'desktop-login' : xorg + native greeter, user desktop after admission ]:.

.: globals :.

  zenki.enabled  =  cube p7-log system X-11 login-screen

## deliberately absent : openbox, compton, login-screen-session. the root ##
## grant path starts the user's supervisor after authentication.          ##

.: zenki :.

## host overlay example [ not applied by this tracked example ] :         ##
## /etc/protocol-7/host-config/v7-zenki.cfg :                             ##
##   load.start_setup = desktop-login                                     ##
## /etc/protocol-7/host-config/X-11.cfg :                                 ##
##   X-11.mode = xorg                                                     ##
## /etc/protocol-7/host-config/login-screen.cfg :                         ##
##   login-screen.auth.allow = your-user                                  ##
##                                                                        ##
## also create cfg/zenki/openbox/openbox.your-user.xml on the target      ##
## checkout. no host is started or changed by this example.               ##

### rudimentary backend update wrapper [ started on request, not enabled ] ###

  - pull-git

      max_concurrency = 1
      dependencies = cube

      : v7-init :
        start_mode = exec-external
        exec_bin = p7-git-pull--rebase
        exec_usr = root

